# i18n Rules

## Player-visible text

In `presentation/` and locale files:

- Use `tr("MODULE_KEY")` for every label, button, tooltip, toast
- Keys: `SCREAMING_SNAKE` with module prefix (`INV_`, `COMBAT_`, `TREE_`)
- Add entries to both `locales/pt_BR.po` and `locales/en.po`

## Do not

- Hardcode Portuguese or English in `label.text = "..."` in presentation code
- Split translatable sentences across concatenated strings
- Put `tr()` inside domain/combat logic — domain returns keys or codes; UI translates

## Dynamic content

Items and skills may still use literal `nome` / `skill_name` from resources during migration. New resources should add `name_key` / `description_key` fields when possible.

## Parameters

```gdscript
tr("COMBAT_WORLD_UNLOCKED") % world_id
```

Define full sentence in each `.po` file; keep `%` placeholder order identical across locales.

## Testing

Switch project locale to `en` and verify no truncated labels in inventory and tree panels.

